munication'=>'Ìbánisọ̀rọ̀','Compatible up to'=>'Ó ni ibamu de','complete the opt-in'=>'par pari iforukọsilẹ na','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'A ku oriire','Never miss an important update'=>'Máṣe jẹ́ kí ìsọfúnni pàtàkì èyíkéyìí yọ́ ọ́ lọ́wọ́','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Ẹ ṣe pupọ fun mimu imudojuiwọn wa si %1$s v%2$s!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Gba lati gba awọn ifitonileti imeeli fun aabo & awọn imudojuiwọn ẹya, akoonu eto-ẹkọ, ati awọn ipese lẹẹkọọkan, ati lati pin diẹ ninu awọn alaye ayika WordPress ipilẹ. Eyi yoo ran wa lọwọ lati jẹ ki %s ni ibamu diẹ sii pẹlu aaye rẹ ati dara julọ ni ṣiṣe ohun ti o nilo rẹ fun.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Yọ̀ǹda láti gba àwọn ìfitónilétí imeeli fún àwọn àfikún ààbò & ẹ̀yà, àwọn ohun àlùmọ̀ ìkẹ́kọ̀ọ́, àti àwọn ìpèsè ìgbà anfaani, àti láti pín àwọn ìfitónilétí ibi àyíká WordPress ipilẹ̀ kan.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Tí o bá fò èyí sílẹ̀, kò burú! %1$s yóò ṣì máa ṣiṣẹ́ dáadáa.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'A ti ṣafihan àṣàyàn yìí kí o má baà padanu ìfilọlẹ pàtàkì kankan kí o sì lè ràn wa lọwọ lati jẹ ki %s baamu diẹ sii pẹlu aaye ayelujara rẹ ti o si dara julọ ni ṣiṣe ohun ti o nilo rẹ fun.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Inu wa dun lati ṣafihan ìṣọ̀kan ipele nẹtiwọki Freemius.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Nígbà ìgbàsílẹ̀ náà, a ríi pé %s ojú-w