'API','An unknown error has occurred while trying to set the user\'s beta mode.'=>'Aṣiṣe ti a ko mọ ti waye nigbati o n gbiyanju lati ṣeto ipo beta olumulo naa.','An unknown error has occurred while trying to toggle the license\'s white-label mode.'=>'Aṣìṣe àìmọ̀ kan ti wáyé nígbà tí a ń gbìyànjú láti yí ipò àmì funfun ti ìwé-àṣẹ padà.','Annual'=>'Ọdọọdun','By clicking "Opt Out", %s will no longer be able to view your name and email.'=>'Nípa títẹ "Opt Out", %s kò ní lè wo orúkọ rẹ àti ímeèlì rẹ mọ́.','By clicking "Opt Out", diagnostic data will no longer be sent to %s.'=>'Nipa tite "Opt Out", a kii yoo tun fi data iwadi ranṣע si %s mọ.','By disconnecting the website, previously shared diagnostic data about %1$s will be deleted and no longer visible to %2$s.'=>'Nípa yíyọ ojú òpó wẹ́bù náà kúrò, data ìwádìí tí a pín tẹ́lẹ̀ nípa %1$s ni a óò pa rẹ́, kò sì ní hàn mọ́ fún %2$s.','By opting out from sharing this information with the updates server, you’ll have to check for new %1$s releases and manually download & install them. Not just a hassle, but missing an update can put your site at risk and cause undue compatibility issues, so we highly recommend keeping these essential permissions on.'=>'Nípa yíyọ ara rẹ̀ kúrò nínú pípín ìwífún yìí pẹ̀lú sínkà ìsọfúnni, o ní láti ṣàyẹ̀wò fún àwọn ìfilọlẹ̀ %1$s tuntun kí o sì ṣe agbékalẹ̀ àti fi sílẹ̀ fúnra rẹ. Kì í ṣe ìṣòro nìkan, ṣùgbọ́n àìní ìfilọlẹ̀ kan lè fi ojúskìn sí ewu kí ó sì fa àwọn ìṣòro ìbáramu tí kò yẹ, nítorí náà a gba ọ ní ìmọ̀ràn gidigidi láti jẹ́ kí àwọn àṣẹ pàtàkì wọ̀nyí wà ní ṣíṣí.','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'Fagile %1$s - Emi ko nilo awọn imudojuiwọn aabo & ẹya kankan mọ, tabi atilẹyin fun %2$s nitori Emi ko gbero lati lo %3$s lori eyi, tabi eyikeyi aaye miiran.','Cancel %s?'=>'Ṣe o fẹ fagile %s?','Cancelling %s'=>'Fagile %s kuro','Cancelling %s...'=>'Fagile %s...','Click here'=>'Tẹ ibi','Deactivating'=>'Ń ṣe àìmúrasílẹ̀','Disconnecting the website will permanently remove %s from your User Dashboard\'s account.'=>'Geeti wẹbusaiti naa yoo yọ %s kuro ninu akọọlẹ Dasibọọdu Oniwun rẹ laelae.','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'Fun ìfiránṣẹ́ àìṣọwọ́ fún àwọn ìmúdàgbàsókè ààbò & ẹ̀yà ara, àti ìṣàkoso & ààbò ìwé àṣẹ, %s nílò láti:','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'Fún ìfiṣẹ̀dánilójú àti àwọn ìsọdọtun ẹ̀yà ara, àti ìṣàkóso ìwé-àṣẹ, %s nílò láti','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius ni ẹ̀rọ iṣakoso ìwé-àṣẹ àti àwọn ìsọdọtun sọfitiwia wa','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'Tí èyí bá jẹ́ ẹ̀dà pípẹ́, láti jẹ́ kí àwọn ìsọdọ̀tun aláìníṣẹ́ǹkọ̀ àti àwọn iṣẹ́ ìránṣẹ́ tí a san owó lé lórí wà ní ipò lẹ́yìn %1$s, jọ̀wọ́ %2$s.','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'Ṣé %2$s jẹ́ ẹ̀dà kejì ti %4$s?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Darapọ mọ Ètò Bẹta','Join the Beta program'=>'Darapọ mọ ètò Beta','License'=>'Iwe-ašẹ','License Key'=>'Bọtìnì Ìwé Àṣẹ','License key'=>'Bọtìnì ìwé-àṣẹ','Monthly'=>'Osù-osù','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Àwọn orúkọ, àwọn slug, àwọn ẹ̀dà, àti bóyá wọ́n ń ṣiṣẹ́ tàbí wọn kò ní ṣiṣẹ́','New Version Available'=>'Ẹ̀yà Tuntun Wà','Optional'=>'Aṣayan','Plan'=>'Ètò','Products'=>'Àwọn Ọjà','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Pipin data ti a nṣe ayẹwo rẹ ranlọwọ lati pese iṣẹ-ṣiṣe afikun ti o ni ibatan si oju opo wẹẹbu rẹ, yago fun awọn aisedede ẹya WordPress tabi PHP ti o le fọ oju opo wẹẹbu naa, ati mọ awọn ede ati agbegbe ti o yẹ ki o tumọ %s si ati ṣe deede si.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Nitorinaa o le tun lo iwe-ašẹ naa nigbati %s ko ba si ni sise mo.','Subscription'=>'Ìforúkọṣílẹ̀','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s yoo ma ran data ìwé àṣẹ pàtàkì sí %2$s léraléra láti ṣàyẹ̀wò àwọn ohun àmúṣe àti àwọn àfikún ààbò, àti láti mọ̀ dájú pé ìwé àṣẹ rẹ wúlò.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'%1$s ti %2$s wa.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Lati ri daju pe ohun gbogbo n ṣiṣẹ pọ daradara ati lati yago fun awọn aiyede pẹlu awọn afikun ati awọn akori ti o fi sori ẹrọ.','Trial'=>'Àpilẹ̀kọ ìdánwò','View %s State'=>'Wo Ipo %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Wo Alaye Ipilẹ %s','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Bẹẹni, %2$s jẹ ẹda ti %4$s fun idi idanwo, ipele, tabi idagbasoke.','You have a %s license.'=>'O ni ìwé àṣẹ %s kan.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'O ti ra iwe-aşẹ %s kan.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'O yẹ ki o gba imeeli ìfìdí-mulẹ̀ fún %1$s sí àpótí ìfiránṣẹ́ rẹ ní %2$s. Jọ̀wọ́ rí i dajú pé o tẹ bọ́tìnnì tó wà nínú imeeli yẹn láti %3$s.','days'=>'àwọn ọjọ́','deactivating'=>'ń yọ kúrò nínú iṣẹ́','hour'=>'wakati','hours'=>'àkókò wákàtí','license'=>'ìwé àṣẹ','optional'=>'a yàn láàyè','products'=>'àwọn ọjà','skip'=>'fò kọjá','subscription'=>'ìforúkọ sílẹ̀','trial'=>'ìdánwò','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Àwọn Ọjà','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Ń mú ṣiṣẹ́','as software licenseLicense'=>'Iwe-ašẹ','close a windowDismiss'=>'Ko sí','close windowDismiss'=>'Pa kuro','like websitesSites'=>'Àwọn ojula wẹbù','nounPricing'=>'Iye owo','trial periodTrial'=>'Idanwo','verbOpt In'=>'Gba Ilọkan','verbOpt Out'=>'Jade kuro','verbSkip'=>'Fò já sí','verbUpgrade'=>'Ṣe agbega','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s sẹ́yìn','Blocks with repeated items, and synced patterns'=>'Àwọn bọ́ọ̀lù pẹ̀lú àwọn ohun tí a tún ṣe, àti àwọn àpẹẹrẹ tí a mú ṣọ̀kan','Comments and reviews'=>'Àwọn àlàyé àti àwọn àtúnyẹ̀wò','Translated automatically from %s.'=>'A fi aifọwọyi tumọ lati %s.','WooCommerce currencies'=>'Àwọn owó WooCommerce','Currency'=>'Owó Ẹ́rọ','The rate source does not quote %s, the shop\'s currency.'=>'Orísí ìwọ̀n kò sọ iye %s, owó ilé ìtajà náà.','"%s" is not a currency WooCommerce knows, or it is the shop\'s own currency.'=>'"%s" kò sí lára àwọn owó tí WooCommerce mọ̀, tàbí ó jẹ́ owó ilé ìtajà náà fúnra rẹ̀.','Enter a rate above zero for %s, like 0.92.'=>'Tẹ oṣuwọn kan ti o wa loke odo fun %s, bii 0.92.','Rounding steps and price endings are amounts, like 0.05 or 0.99.'=>'Àwọn ìgbésẹ̀ ìborí àti ìparí owó jẹ́ ìwọ̀n, bí 0.05 tàbí 0.99.','Custom fields (ACF, Meta Box, Pods)'=>'Àwọn àfikún ààyè (ACF, Meta Box, Pods)','Choose translate, copy or leave empty for each field.'=>'Yan ìtumọ, daakọ tabi fi sílẹ̀ ní ṣofo fún olúkúlùkù ààyè.','Forms (Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms, Fluent Forms)'=>'Àwọn fọ́ọ̀mù (Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms, Fluent Forms)','I enter the rates myself'=>'Mo tẹ awọn oṣuwọn naa nipa ara mi','European Central Bank, updated daily (free, no account needed)'=>'European Central Bank, ti a n ṣe imudojuiwọn ni ojoojumọ (ọfẹ, ko nilo akọọlẹ kan)','The European Central Bank answered %d. The last rates are kept.'=>'Ilé Ìfowópamọ́ Àárín Gbùngbùn Yúróòpù dáhùn %d. A tọ́jù àwọn owó ẹ̀dùn tó gbẹ̀yìn náà sílẹ̀.','The European Central Bank\'s feed held no rates. The last rates are kept.'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀ ilé-iṣẹ́ ìnáwó European Central Bank kò ní ìwọ̀n kankan. A tọ́jú ìwọ̀n tó kẹ́yìn sílẹ̀.','That exchange-rate source is not available.'=>'Orisun oṣuwọn paṣipaarọ yẹn ko si.','SEO plugins (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress, All in One SEO)'=>'Àwọn ìlànà SEO (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress, All in One SEO)','Theme and plugin text'=>'Àkọsílẹ àti pílọ́gìn (plugin)','That theme or plugin is not active on this site.'=>'Ko si akori tabi plugin yẹn ti o nṣiṣẹ lori aaye yii.','Language suggestion'=>'Ìbéèrè èdè','This page is also available in %s.'=>'Ojú ewé yìí tún wà ní %s.','Read it in %s'=>'Ka a ninu %s','No thanks'=>'Rara o seun','Choose how languages appear in your addresses: a folder, a subdomain, a separate domain or a query parameter.'=>'Yan bí àwọn èdè ṣe hàn nínú àwọn àdírẹsì rẹ: fóńdà kan, àbápínlẹ̀ (subdomain), agbègbè ọtọ̀tọ̀ (domain) tàbí ìbéèrè ìparí (query parameter).','Subdomains and separate domains per language are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Awọn subdomain ati awọn agbegbe lọtọ fun ede kọọkan jẹ apakan ti Tranzly Pro.','The language folders must be a list.'=>'Àwọn fọ́lífà èdè gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ àtòjọ.','"%s" cannot be a language folder. Use 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens, different for every language, and not a word WordPress already uses.'=>'"%s" kò le jẹ fífà èdè. Lo àwọn lẹ́tà kékeré 2 sí 12, àwọn nọ́mbà tàbí àwọn àmì ìdájọ́, tí ó yàtọ̀ fún èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan, tí kì í ṣe ọ̀rọ̀ tí WordPress ti ń lò tẹ́lẹ̀.','The domains must be a list.'=>'Awọn agbegbe wọnyi gbọdọ jẹ atọka kan.','"%s" is not a domain name, such as example.de.'=>'"%s" kii ṣe orukọ agbegbe, bii example.de.','Each language needs its own domain.'=>'Ò kèkè ni èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan ni agbègbè rẹ̀.','The translated address words must be a list.'=>'Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ àdírẹ̀sì tí a ti túmọ̀ gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ àkójọ.','The translated address words must be listed per language.'=>'Awọn ọrọ adirẹsi ti a tumọ gbọdọ wa ni atokọ fun ede kọọkan.','"%s" cannot be used in an address. Use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'"%s" ko le jẹ lilo ninu adirẹsi kan. Lo awọn lẹta kekere, awọn nọmba, ati awọn ami ayọkẹlẹ (-).','This setting is on or off.'=>'Ètò yìí wà ní títàn tàbí pipa.','Hiding untranslated pages from search engines is part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Titẹ awọn oju-iwe ti a ko tumọ mọ kuro lọdọ awọn ẹrọ iṣawari jẹ apakan ti Tranzly Pro.','Languages (as a submenu)'=>'Àwọn Èdè','Languages (side by side)'=>'Àwọn èdè (ní ẹ̀gbẹ́ ará wọn)','Add to Menu'=>'Fi kún Àkójọ aṣonjẹ','On your site, this item shows the site\'s languages, each linking to the current page in that language.'=>'Lórí ojú-wẹ́bù rẹ, nǹkan yìí fi àwọn èdè ojú-wẹ́bù náà hàn, èkọ̀ọ̀kan wọn ń sopọ̀ mọ́ ojú-wẹ́bù lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ ní èdè yẹn.','%1$s (%2$d)'=>'%1$s (%2$d)','Links to this page in each of your languages.'=>'Awọn ọna aṣopọ si oju-iwe yii ni olukuluku awọn ede rẹ.','Language name'=>'Oruko ede','Language code'=>'Koodu ede','Name and code'=>'Oruko ati koodu','Design'=>'Apẹrẹ','Show each language as'=>'Fi èdè kọọkan han gẹgẹbi','Show flags (a flag is a country, not a language)'=>'Fi awọn àfíhàn han (àfíhàn jẹ orílẹ̀-èdè, kì í ṣe èdè kan)','List'=>'Àtòjọ','Pills'=>'Àwọn ohunèlò ìrànlọ́wọ́ kékeré','Buttons'=>'Awọn bọtini','Dropdown'=>'Akojọ ti o n ṣubu silẹ','Language codes'=>'Àwọn àmì èdè','Flags'=>'Àwọn àmì','Include the current language'=>'Fi ede lọwọlọwọ kun un','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Fi awọn ede ti a ko tumọ oju-iwe yii si pamọ','Stack vertically'=>'Ko sori si isale','Accessible label'=>'Àwọn àmì tó ṣeé wọlé','Text'=>'Ọrọ','Background'=>'Ẹ̀yìn','Current language text'=>'Èdè lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ báyìí','Current language background'=>'Abẹ́lẹ̀ èdè lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́','Border'=>'Ààrùn','Corner radius'=>'Ìwọ̀n borititi igun','Space between languages'=>'Ààyè láàárín àwọn èdè','Text size'=>'Iwọn ọrọ','Switcher'=>'Aṣọ̀yípadà','(no title)'=>'(kò sí àkọlé)','There is nothing to fix here.'=>'Kò sí ohun kan tí ó yẹ kí a ṣe àtúnṣe sí níbí.','No content type is translated on this site.'=>'Ko si irisi akoonu kankan ti a tumọ sori aaye yii.','That content type is not translated on this site.'=>'Àì ṣe agbèdè sí èdè miiran ni iṣẹ́ akoonu yìí lori ojú-opoìn yìí.','There is nothing to translate in that selection.'=>'Ko si ohun kan lati tumọ ninu yiyan yẹn.','Choose at least one language to translate into.'=>'Yan o kere ju ede kan lati tumo si.','You are not allowed to export translations.'=>'A kò gba ọ laaye lati gbe awọn itumọjade jade.','Choose an XLIFF or CSV file to import.'=>'Yan faili XLIFF tabi CSV lati gbe wọle.','That is not a Tranzly XLIFF or CSV file. Export one first, translate it, and import it here.'=>'Iyẹn kii ṣe faili Tranzly XLIFF tabi CSV kan. Gbe ọkan jade ni akọkọ, tumọ rẹ, ki o si gbe e wọle si ibi.','The file could not be stored for importing. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'A kò lè fi fáìlì náà pamọ́ fún ìgbéwọlé. Rí daju pé a lè kọ sí inú fọ́lífà àwọn tí a gbé sọ́tọ̀.','That import is not there any more. Upload the file again.'=>'Ìgbéwọlé yẹn kò sí níbẹ̀ mọ́. Tun gbe fáìlì náà soke.','That page is not on this site any more.'=>'Ojú-ewé yẹn kò sí lórí ojú-opó yìí mọ́.','The file is for a language this site does not have.'=>'Fáìlì náà jẹ́ ti èdè kan tí ojú òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí kò ní.','Could not link %1$s %2$d: %3$s'=>'Ko le sopọ %1$s %2$d: %3$s','Post #%1$d: %2$s'=>'Fiṣé #%1$d: %2$s','No data from that plugin was found on this site.'=>'A ko ri data kankan lati inu plọọgi-in yen lori aaye yii.','This is not a translation of anything on this site.'=>'Èyí kò ṣeé túmọ̀ sí ohunkóohun lórí ojú òpó wẹ́bù yìí.','There is no text to check.'=>'Ko si ọrọ kankan lati ṣayẹwo.','The AI settings are not part of this build.'=>'Àwọn ètò AI kò jẹ́ apá kan ìkọ́ yìí.','The AI provider did not answer.'=>'Olupese AI ko dahun.','The AI model did not score every part of this page. Try again, or choose another model.'=>'Àwòṣe AI náà kò ṣe àmì sí apá kankan ojú ewé yìí. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i, tàbí yan àwòṣe mìíràn.','Translator'=>'Olùtumọ̀','Translation reviewer'=>'Olùyẹ̀wọ̀ ìtumọ̀','A reviewer asked for changes to this translation.'=>'Olùṣàyẹ̀wọ̀ kan béèrè fún àwọn àtúnṣe sí ìtumọ̀ yìí.','A reviewer asked for changes to this translation: %s'=>'Olùyẹ̀wò kan béèrè àwọn àtúnṣe sí ìtumọ̀ yìí: %s','This translation is waiting for a reviewer. Publishing it (as a reviewer) approves it.'=>'Túmọ̀ yìí ń dúró de olúyẹ̀wò. Títẹ̀ ẹ́ jalo (gẹ́gẹ́ bí olúyẹ̀wò) ń fọwọ́ sí i.','Only a translation can be reviewed.'=>'Ìtumọ̀ nìkan ni a lè ṣe àtúnyẹ̀wẹ̀ sí.','Choose what happens when an original changes: nothing, mark its translations out of date, or translate them again.'=>'Yan ohun ti yoo ṣẹlẹ nigbati atilẹba ba yipada: ko si nkan, samisi awọn itumọ rẹ gẹgẹbi eyiti akoko rẹ ti kọja, tabi tumọ wọn lẹẹkansi.','The quality threshold is a score from 0 to 100.'=>'Ẹnu-ọ̀nà dídára jẹ́ àmì kan láti 0 dé 100.','Show hidden suggestions on the Overview again'=>'Fi àwọn àbẹ̀wò tí ó fipamọ́ han lórí Ìkọ̀lù lẹ́ẹ̀kan si','All'=>'Gbogbo','%d selected'=>'%d ti a yan','Nothing matches.'=>'Kò sí ohun tó bá mu.','Select all on this page'=>'Yan ohun gbogbo lori oju-iwe yii','Select'=>'Yan','Pages'=>'Àwọn ojúewé','Previous'=>'Tẹ́lẹ̀','Page %1$d of %2$d'=>'Ojú-ìwé %1$d ti %2$d','Set up %s in a few minutes'=>'Ṣe agbekalẹ %s ni iṣẹju diẹ si','Start setup'=>'Bẹrẹ iṣeto','This site'=>'Aaye yii','Edition'=>'Ẹ̀dà','Sites on this licence'=>'Àwọn ojúlé lórí ìwé àṣẹ yìí','Version'=>'Ẹ̀dà','This looks like a staging or local copy, so it does not use up a site on your licence.'=>'Èyí dà bí àwọn àwòkọ ìgbàdíẹ̀ tàbí ti agbègbè, nítorí náà kò ní lò ojúsówọ̀ kankan lórí ìwé àṣẹ rẹ.','See what Pro adds'=>'Wo ohun ti Pro fi kun un','Go to'=>'Lọ sí','Personal'=>'Ti ara ẹni','Business'=>'Iṣẹ-ṣiṣe','Agency'=>'Ajọ','Any number of sites'=>'Àwọn ojúlé nígbàkúùgbà','Unlimited sites'=>'Àwọn ojula àìlóǹkà','%d site'=>'ojula %d','Pro'=>'Pro','%s trial'=>'%s idanwo','Your trial has started. Reload the page to see every Pro feature.'=>'Idanwo rẹ ti bẹrẹ. Ṣe atunkọ oju-iwe naa lati rii gbogbo ẹya ara ẹrọ Pro.','The trial could not be started.'=>'A kò lè bẹ̀rẹ̀ àdánwò náà.','Feature'=>'Àlámọ̀','Included'=>'Ti wa ninu','Not included'=>'Kò ní nínú','Your licence'=>'Lẹ́ẹ̀wọ̀ rẹ','%1$d of %2$d in use'=>'%1$d ninu %2$d ti n lo','Renews'=>'Túnṣe rẹ̀','Staging, test and localhost copies of a site are free and never count toward your site limit.'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀dà ìpele (staging), ìdánwò (test), àti localhost ti ojú òpó wọ́pọ̀, wọn kò sì ní ka sí i nínú àwọn àlàfo ojú òpó rẹ rí.','Your plan includes priority support.'=>'Ètò rẹ ní ìtìlẹ́yìn pàtàkì nínú.','Manage your licence and billing'=>'Ṣàkóso ìwé-àṣẹ àti owó rẹ','Get more with Pro'=>'Gba diẹ sii pẹlu Pro','Start a free %d-day trial, no card needed'=>'Bẹrẹ ìdánwò ọ̀fẹ́ ọjọ́ %d, kò nílò káàdì','See plans and prices'=>'Wo awọn eto ati awọn owo rẹ','Use Tranzly and Page Builder Sandwich together? The bundle includes both Pro plugins for less.'=>'Se Tranzly ati Page Builder Sandwich papọ? Apapo naa ni awọn afikun Pro mejeeji ninu fun idiyele ti o dinku.','Your licence has expired. Renew it to keep getting updates and Pro features.'=>'Ìwé àṣẹ rẹ ti parí. Ṣe àtúnṣe rẹ̀ láti máa gba àwọn ìsọfúnni tuntun àti àwọn ẹ̀yà Pro lọ́wọ́.','Renew now'=>'Tun bẹrẹ nisisiyi','Compare the plans'=>'Fi awọn eto wọwe ara wọn','Search features'=>'Àwọn ànímọ́ ìwárí','Area'=>'Agbègbè','Included in'=>'Pẹlu ninu','No feature matches.'=>'Ko si ànímọ́ ti o baamu.','Features by plan'=>'Àwọn ohun ànímọ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí ètò iṣẹ́','Hide'=>'Fi pamọ́','Activate it on the Plugins screen'=>'Mú u ṣiṣẹ lori iboju Awọn afikun (Plugins)','Install it'=>'Fi sori ẹ','Overview'=>'Àkópọ̀','Setup'=>'Ìṣètò','Plans and licence'=>'Àwọn ètò àti ìwé àṣẹ','Add-ons'=>'Àfikún','Get help'=>'Gbà ìrànlọ́wọ́','Feedback'=>'Èrò padà','Your choice could not be saved.'=>'Àכוֹyọ̀ rẹ kò lè fipamọ́.','The setup state could not be saved.'=>'A ko le fi ipo iṣeto pamọ.','Match my computer'=>'Ba kọmputa mi mu','Light'=>'Fẹlẹlẹ','Dark'=>'Òkùnkùn','Colour scheme'=>'Ìpìlẹ̀ àwọ̀','Help'=>'Ìrànlọ́wọ́','Guide to this screen'=>'Itọsọna si oju-iwo yii','Take the tour'=>'Ṣe ìṣẹ̀wò náà','Get help or report a bug'=>'Gbà ìrànwọ́ tàbí ròyìn àṣìṣe kan','Plugin screens'=>'Awọn oju-iwe afikun','That could not be saved.'=>'A kò lè fipamọ́ yẹn.','Before you contact support'=>'Ṣaju ki o to kan aṣoju iranlọwọ','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'Awon ibeere re ni a fi ranse lati ojula yi si %s, awon ti o se afikun yi. A n fi ranse:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'adirẹsi imeeli rẹ ati orukọ rẹ, ki a le dahun;','the subject and message you write;'=>'koko ati ifiranṣẹ ti o kọ;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'ID ìṣẹ́-òfin rẹ, nítorí náà àwọn oníbàárà tí wọ́n ń sanwó gba ààyè àkọ́kọ́;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'nikan ti o ba samisi rẹ: awọn alaye aaye (awọn ẹya WordPress ati PHP, akori, awọn afikun, apakan kan ti log aṣiṣe pẹlu awọn ọrọ igbaniwọle ati awọn adirẹsi imeeli ti yọ kuro), eyiti o le ka ṣaaju fifiranṣẹ;','only if you add them: logins for your site, stored encrypted and deleted 30 days after your request is closed.'=>'nikan ti o ba fi kun wọn: awọn iwọle fun aaye rẹ, ti o fipamọ sẹhin ati ti paarẹ awọn ọjọ 30 lẹhin ti a ti pa ibeere rẹ mọ.','Privacy policy'=>'Ètò ìpamọ́','I agree, continue'=>'Mo gbàgbọ́, tẹ̀ siwaju','The connection could not be checked.'=>'A kò lè ṣàyẹ̀wò asopọ̀ náà.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Ko ṣiṣẹ yẹn. Gbiyanju lẹẹkan si.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Atileyin Zinn Digital® ti ge isopọ si aaye yii.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Ìtìlẹ́yìn Zinn Digital® kò mọ ojula yii mọ.','You disconnected this site.'=>'O ti ge asopọ aaye yii.','Connect this site to support'=>'So oju opo wẹbù yii pọ mọ atilẹyin','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'Àsopọ̀ náà ti wà. Àwọn ìdáhùn lọ sí %s.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Kò sopọ̀. O lè fi ìbéèrè ránṣẹ́ pẹ̀lú àdírẹ́sì ímeèlì rẹ ní ìsàlẹ̀ yìí; sopọ̀ pọ̀ ń fipamọ́ títẹ̀ rẹ ní gbogbo ìgbà.','E-mail address'=>'Adirẹsi imeeli','Your name (optional)'=>'Oruko re (ko deraju)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Mo gba láti so ojula yii pọ mọ atilẹyin Zinn Digital®. Ó n ran adirẹsi ojula yii, awọn ẹya WordPress ati PHP ati ẹya plugin naa si, ati pe a le ge asopọ rẹ nigbakugba lati ibi tabi nipasẹ Zinn Digital®.','Connect'=>'So pọ̀','I need help'=>'Mo nilo iranlọwọ','Report a bug'=>'Ṣe ìròyìn àṣìṣe kan','Send feedback'=>'Fi esi ranṣẹ','Request a feature'=>'Bere lọ́wọ́ fún ẹ̀kọ́ tuntun kan','The site details could not be read.'=>'A kò lè ka àwọn àlàyé ojú-wọ̀ọ̀sì náà.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'A kò lè rán ìbéèrè rẹ síṣẹ́. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i lẹ́yìn ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀.','WordPress admin'=>'Abojuto WordPress','File manager'=>'Olùṣàkóso fáìlì','cPanel'=>'cPanel','FTP / SFTP'=>'FTP / SFTP','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Èsì àti àwọn ohun tí a nílò fún ẹ̀yọ ara rẹ̀','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'A ti fi ranṣẹ. Ìtọ́kasí rẹ ni %s, ìdáhùn wa yóò sì dé nípasẹ̀ ímeèlì.','What is it about?'=>'Kini nipa re?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'Gbèsì sí (imeèlì)','Subject'=>'Olori oro','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Kí ni o ṣe, kí ni o retí, kí sì ni ó ṣẹlẹ̀ ní dípò bẹ́ẹ̀?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Fi alaye aaye kun (awọn ẹya, akori, awọn afikun, apakan akọọlẹ aṣiṣe)','See exactly what is sent'=>'Wo ohun ti a ran gangan','Loading…'=>'Ń lo lọ́wọ́…','Logins for support (optional, stored encrypted)'=>'Àwọn ìwọlé fún ìtìlẹ́yìn (kò pọn dandan, a tọ́jú wọn nípa fífún wọn ní àìlera)','A login is only sent with its password. Leave a row out rather than half-filled.'=>'Wiwọle kan nikan ni a fi ranṣẹ pẹlu ọrọ igbaniwọle rẹ. Fi ila kan silẹ dipo ki o jẹ idaji-kún.','Login address'=>'Adirẹsi iwọle','Username'=>'Orúkọ olùṣe','Password'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà','Add a login'=>'Fi wọlé kún rẹ','Create a temporary support login'=>'Ṣẹ̀dáwọ̀ ẹ̀yà àtìlẹ́yìn fún ìgbà díẹ̀','A separate user for our support team, without access to users, plugins installation or code editing. It is deleted automatically when it expires, or whenever you revoke it below.'=>'Olùmúlòọtọ̀rọ̀ tọ́tọ́tò fún ẹgbẹ́ ìtìlẹ́yìn wa, láìní ààyè sí àwọn olùmúlò, ì fi sórí ohun èlò tàbí ṣiṣàtúnṣe kóòdù. A ń pa á rẹ́ nípa ara rẹ nígbà tí ó bá parí àkókò rẹ̀, tàbí nígbàkígbà tí o bá fagile rẹ̀ ní ìsàlẹ̀ yìí.','Yes, for %d day'=>'Bẹẹni, fún ọjọ́ %d','Send'=>'Fi ránṣẹ́','The list could not be loaded.'=>'A kò lè kó àkójọ náà jáde.','That login could not be removed.'=>'A kò lè yọ ìwọlé yẹn kúrò.','Temporary support logins'=>'Awọn ìwọlé ìtìlẹ́yìn fún ìgbà díẹ̀','None. Support can only log in to this site if you create a login here.'=>'Ko si. Atileyin le wole si aaye yii nikan ti o ba seda iwole kan nibi.','expired, being removed'=>'tí parí igbẹ́ yíyọ̀ kúrò','expires %s'=>'fi ipari %s','Revoke now'=>'Fagile bayisii','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'Ìgbésẹ̀ %1$d nínú %2$d','Close the tour'=>'Pa ìrin-àjò náà dé','Back'=>'Padà','Everything in one place'=>'Gbogbo rẹ̀ ní ibi kan','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Awọn taabu wọnyi yori si gbogbo iboju ti plugin náà: iṣeto, awọn eto, iwe-aṣẹ rẹ, iranlọwọ ati diẹ sii.','Help on every screen'=>'Ìrànlọ́wọ́ lórí gbogbo ojú ìwé','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Ṣí àkójọ yìí fún ìtọ́sọ́nà sí ojú-ìwé tí o wà, ìrìn-àjò yìí, tàbí láti béèrè ìrànlọ́wọ́ lọ́wọ́ wa.','Light or dark'=>'Imọlẹ tabi òkùnkùn','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Yan imọlẹ, òkùnkùn, tabi bakannaa bi kọmputa rẹ. A óò ranti yiyan rẹ fun iwọ nikan.','Welcome'=>'Kaabo','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Irin-ajo kukuru yii fihan ibi ti awọn nkan wa. O le jade kuro ninu rẹ nigbakugba pẹlu bọtini Escape.','Your site at a glance'=>'Ojula oju opo wẹẹti rẹ','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'Ilọsiwaju iṣeto ati eto rẹ ni a fihan nibi, pẹlu ohun ti o tẹle ti o tọ lati ṣe.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Eto rẹ, àwọn ojú-wọ́gbà mélòó ni ó bo, àti pé bóyá ẹ̀dà ojú-wọ́gbà yìí ka sí i nínú ààlà yẹn.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Gbiyanju Pro tabi sọ di tuntun','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Bẹrẹ ìdánwò ọ̀fẹ́ láìní káàdì, ṣe àgbéga, tàbí túnṣe, gbogbo rẹ̀ láti ibi yìí.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Gbogbo ẹ̀ya àti ètò tí ó ní i nínú. Wá ẹ̀ya kan tàbí fi agbègbè kan hàn ní ẹ̀ẹ̀kan.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Diẹ sii lati Zinn Digital®','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Àwọn plógììn tó ń bá èyí ṣiṣẹ́, àti àwọn iṣẹ́ láti ọ̀dọ̀ ẹ̀gbẹ́ kan náà. O lè tún fi àwọn káàdì tí o pamọ́ sórí àwọn ojú ìwé míràn hàn níhìn-ín.','Connect for faster help'=>'So pọ̀ mọ́ra fún ìrànlọ́wọ́ tó yára jù','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Wiwe po yiyan ni. O jẹ ki o firanṣẹ awọn ibeere laisi titẹ imeeli rẹ ni akoko kọọkan, ati pe o le ge asopọ nigbakugba ti o ba fẹ.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Beere fún ìrànlọ́wọ́ tàbí jábọ̀ àṣìṣe kan','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Ṣapejuwe ohun ti o ṣẹlẹ. O yan boya lati so alaye aaye pọ, ati pe o le rii daju deede ohun ti o ni ni akọkọ.','Temporary support access'=>'Wiwọle atilẹyin fun igba diẹ','If support needs to look inside your site, create a temporary login here. It deletes itself when it expires, and you can remove it at any time.'=>'Tí àwọn ẹ̀ka ìrànlọ́wọ́ bá nílò láti wọ inú ojú òpó wébìì rẹ, ṣẹ̀dá ààyè ìwọlé fún ìgbà díẹ̀ níbí. Ó ń pa ara rẹ̀ rẹ́ nígbà tí àkókò bá parí, o sì lè yọ ọ́ kúrò nígbàkigbà.','Tell us what to build'=>'Sọ fún un wa ohun tí o yẹ kí a kọ́','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'Fi èrè, ìbéèrè fún àfikún tàbí èyíkéyìí ìmọ̀ràn ránṣẹ́. Ó lọ tààrà sí ẹgbẹ́ náà.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Èyí máa ń gba ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀, ó sì ń tún %s ṣe kí ó lè ṣiṣẹ́ lórí ojú opó wẹ́bù yìí lẹ́sẹ̀ kẹsẹ̀. O le yí ohun gbogbo padà nígbà tó bá yá.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'O ti ṣetan. Bí ohunkohun kò bá ṣiṣẹ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí a ṣe retí rẹ̀, a wa ní ì tẹ́ tẹ́ ẹ̀kan ṣoso péré.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'Ìgbésẹ̀ %1$d nínú %2$d: %3$s','Finish'=>'Parí','Skip setup'=>'Foju eto silẹ','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Tí a kọ́ nipasẹ Neil Lock, Alaga Zinn Digital® Ltd','Version %s'=>'Àtẹ̀jáde %s','Tranzly website'=>'Wọ́bìsáìtì Tranzly','Zinn Digital® website'=>'oju opo wẹẹbù Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ awọn eto naa.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Wo àwọn ètò Pro ati iye owó wọn','Languages'=>'Àwọn Èdè','The first language is the one your content is written in. Visitors switch with the language switcher block.'=>'Èdè àkọkọ ni èdè tí a kọ ohun àkóópọ̀ rẹ sí. Àwọn alábèwò lè yí padà pẹ̀lú bálóòkì ìyípadà èdè.','(default)'=>'(àìṣàtúnṣe)','Locale code'=>'Koodu agbegbe','For example fr_FR'=>'Fun apẹẹrẹ fr_FR','Name (optional)'=>'Oruko (ti ko dandan)','For example Français'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ Français','Add language'=>'Fi ede kun','Front-end output'=>'Ìṣajù ojú-òpó wẹ́bù','Class name prefix'=>'Àlẹ̀mọ́ orúkọ kílàásì','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Gbogbo orúkọ kilásì tí plọ́gìnnì náà tẹ̀ sórí ojú ewé rẹ bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú àfikún yìí, nítorí náà ojú ewé náà kò ní fi hàn pé èwo ni plọ́gìnnì tí ó kọ́ wọn. 1 sí 8 lẹ́tà kékeré tàbí nọ́mbà, bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà kan.','Beta updates'=>'Àwọn àfikún Beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Ojula yii n gba awọn ẹya beta gẹgẹbi awọn imudojuiwọn.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Ojula yii n gba awọn ẹya iduroṣinṣin nikan.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Yi eyí padà lori oju-iwe Akawunti','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Awon eya beta ni a n se afihan won fun awon fifi sori Pro ti o ni iwe-ase ti o si ni isopọ mo iroyin won. Ni kete ti o ba ni isopọ, o le darapọ mọ lati oju-iwe Iroyin.','Save settings'=>'Fi àwọn ètò pamọ́','First engine that is set up'=>'Ẹ̀rọ àkọ́kọ́ tí a ṣètò','Key saved. It is stored encrypted and never shown again.'=>'Bọtìnì náà ti fipamọ́. A ti fi ìkọ̀gbọ̀nsẹ̀ pamọ́ kò sì ní hàn mọ́ láé.','Engine settings saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ awọn eto ẹ̀rọ náà.','Glossary saved.'=>'A ti fi Glossary pamọ́.','Your keys'=>'Awọn kọ́ọ̀sì rẹ','Tranzly calls the translation services with your own account. Keys are stored encrypted in your database and are only ever sent to the service they belong to. AI model keys are set in the AI settings.'=>'Tranzly npe awọn iṣẹ itumọ pẹlu akọọlẹ tirẹ. A n fipamọ awọn kọọti ti a ti paroko sinu ibi ipamọ data rẹ, a si n ran wọn nikan si iṣẹ ti wọn jẹ ti wọn. A n ṣeto awọn kọọti awoṣe AI ninu awọn eto AI.','%s API key'=>'Bọtììlì API %s','Saved: %s. Enter a new key to replace it, or save an empty field to remove it.'=>'A ti fipamọ: %s. Tẹ bọtọ titun sẹ́ ti o ba fẹ ropo rẹ, tabi fi aaye ti o ṣofo pamọ lati yọ kuro.','No key saved.'=>'Ko si bọtini ti o fipamọ.','Azure region (leave empty for a global resource)'=>'Agbègbè Azure (fi sílẹ̀ ní ṣóńṣó fún ohun àmúṣọrọ̀ kárí ayé)','Save key'=>'Fi bọtini pamọ','Check my DeepL usage'=>'Ṣàyẹ̀wọ́n lílò DeepL mi','%1$s of %2$s characters used this billing period.'=>'%1$s ninu %2$s àwọn ohun kikọ ni a ti lo ni àsìkò ìwé-owó yii.','Which engine translates'=>'Èwo nínú ẹ̀rọ ló ń túmọ̀','No engine is set up yet. Save a key above (or set up an AI model) to start translating.'=>'Kò tíì sí êngìn tí a ṣètò. Fipamọ́ bọ́tìsì kan sí òkè (tàbí kí o ṣètò àwòṣe AI kan) láti bẹ̀rẹ̀ ìtumọ̀.','Default engine'=>'Ẹrọ aiyipada','A different engine per language, automatic fallback and monthly spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Ẹrọ kan pato fun ede kọọkan, atilẹyin adaṣe ati opin inawo osooṣu jẹ awọn ẹya Tranzly Pro.','Engine for %s'=>'Ẹrọ fún %s','The default engine'=>'Ẹnjini aiyipada','If an engine fails or reaches a limit, try these next, in this order'=>'Tí ẹ̀rọ kan bá kuna tàbí tí ó dé ìwọ̀n, gbìyànjú àwọn wọ̀nyí lẹ́yìn náà, ní ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ yìí','Monthly spending caps'=>'Àwọn ìnáwó oṣooṣù','When an engine reaches its cap, nothing more is sent to it until next month and the failed-translation report says why. Leave empty for no cap.'=>'Nigbati ẹ̀rọ kan ba de opin rẹ̀, kò sí ohun miiran ti a fi ranṣẹ si titi di oṣu ti n bọ ati pe ijabọ itumọ ti o kuna sọ idi rẹ. Fi silẹ ni ṣofo fun ko si opin.','%1$s (spent this month: $%2$s)'=>'%1$s (ti ná lọ oṣù yìí: $%2$s)','Save caps'=>'Fi awọn àpòòpọ̀ pamọ́','Glossary and words never translated'=>'Giolosari ati Awọn ọrọ ti a ko tumọ ri','Never translate these words (one per line)'=>'Ẹ má ṣe túmọ̀ àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ wọ̀nyí rárá (ọ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan fún ìlà kọ̀ọ̀kan)','Brand and product names stay exactly as they are, with every engine.'=>'Awọn orukọ ami iyasọtọ ati ọja ma n wa bi wọ́n ṣe wà, pẹ̀lu gbogbo ẹ̀rọ.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Awọn itumọ ti o fẹ ati ohun ohun fun ede kọọkan jẹ awọn ẹya ara Tranzly Pro.','Preferred translations (one per line: term = translation)'=>'Àwọn ìtumọ̀ tí a fẹ́ràn (ọ̀kan fún ìlà kọ̀ọ̀kan: term = translation)','Formality'=>'Ìgbékalẹ̀ Ìbáṣepọ̀','Default'=>'Àìṣàyàn','Formal'=>'Aṣa ibùwọlé','Informal'=>'Tirẹ-ṣe-ti-o-wọ́pọ̀','Style instructions (audience, brand voice)'=>'Àwọn ìlànà ìrísí (àwọn olùgbọ́, ohùn àmì-ọjà)','Save glossary'=>'Fi ìtumọ pamọ','Settings'=>'Àwọn Ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ','Translation engine'=>'Ẹrọ ìtumọ̀','What Tranzly translates on this site'=>'Ohun ti Tranzly n tumọ lori aaye yii','found, translated with your content'=>'a ti ri, a ti tumọ pẹlu akoonu rẹ','not on this site'=>'kò sí lórí ojú opó yìí','With Tranzly Pro: Elementor, Bricks, Divi, Beaver Builder, Oxygen and WPBakery pages; everything in WooCommerce, with prices in the visitor’s currency; the SEO fields of Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress and All in One SEO; ACF, Meta Box and Pods fields; forms and their e-mails; your theme’s and plugins’ own text; and comments and reviews.'=>'Pẹ̀lú Tranzly Pro: àwọn ojú ewé Elementor, Bricks, Divi, Beaver Builder, Oxygen àti WPBakery; ohun gbogbo nínú WooCommerce, pẹ̀lú àwọn iye owó ní owó àlejò náà; àwọn ààyè SEO ti Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress àti All in One SEO; àwọn ààyè ACF, Meta Box àti Pods; àwọn fọ́ọ̀mù àti àwọn imeeli wọn; ọ̀rọ̀ ti ẹ̀yọ àkòrí rẹ̀ àti àwọn afikun; àti àwọn asọye àti àyẹ̀wò.','Shop text and e-mails'=>'Ọrọ ilé ìtajà àti àwọn imeeli','E-mail subjects and headings, payment and shipping method names, and the checkout notices. Each order’s e-mails go out in the language it was placed in.'=>'Àwọn àkọlé àti àkọlé kékeré fún ìwé ìròyìn Í-mèlì, àwọn orúkọ ọ̀nà ìsanwó àti ìgbéjàde, àti àwọn àkíyèsí ìṣẹ̀dá ìsanwó. Ìwé ìròyìn Í-mèlì ti aṣẹ kọ̀ọ̀kan máa ń jáde ní èdè tí a ti pa á lẹ́ṣẹ̀.','Forms and their e-mails'=>'Àwọn fọ́ọ̀mù àti àwọn í-mẹ́lì wọn','Every form keeps one list of entries; its labels, buttons, messages and e-mails appear in the visitor’s language.'=>'Gbogbo fọọmu ma n tọju atọnisọna awọn wọle kan sọkan; awọn akọle rẹ, awọn bọtini, awọn ifiranṣẹ ati awọn imeeli n han ni ede alejo naa.','Saved.'=>'A fipamọ.','No ACF, Meta Box or Pods fields are defined yet.'=>'A ti defin anfani kankan fun ACF, Meta Box tabi Pods sibẹsibẹ.','Field'=>'Pupa','Where'=>'Nibo','In a translation'=>'Ninu ìtumọ̀','What happens to %s in a translation'=>'Kini yoo ṣẹlẹ si %s ninu itumọ kan','Translate it'=>'Tumọ̀ rẹ̀','Copy it as it is'=>'Ẹ daakọ rẹ̀ gẹ́gẹ́ bí ó ṣe wà','Leave it empty'=>'Fi sé oṣoofo','The shop’s currency'=>'Owó ilé ìtajà náà','Currencies'=>'Àwọn owó','Show prices in other currencies (the shop’s own is %s)'=>'Fi awọn owo han ni awọn owo nina miiran (ti ile-itaja naa ni ni %s)','Exchange rates'=>'Iye ti Awọn Paṣipaarọ','Rates last updated %s.'=>'Awọn oṣuwọn ti ni imudojuiwọn kẹhin ni %s.','Rates have not been fetched yet.'=>'Àwọn iye kò ti i di gbigba.','Update the rates now'=>'Se àwọn ìwọ̀n náà báyìí ni','New currency'=>'Owó ẹ̀rọ titun','Choose…'=>'Yan...','Rate (per 1 %s)'=>'Ìwọ̀n (fún 1 %s kọ̀ọ̀kan)','Typing a rate keeps it: the daily update will not change it.'=>'Titẹ iye kan mọọ: imudojuiwọn ojoojumọ kii yoo yipada.','Rounding'=>'Wiwa si ǹkankan pataki','None'=>'Ko si','Round up'=>'Fi kun pẹlu','Round to the nearest'=>'Yiyi si nọmba to sunmọ julọ','Round down'=>'Yí padà sí ìsàlẹ̀','Round to (for example 1, 0.05 or 10)'=>'Yi borowọ si (fún àpẹrẹ 1, 0.05 tàbí 10)','Prices end in (for example 0.99)'=>'Awọn owo pari pẹlu (fun apẹẹrẹ 0.99)','Add a currency'=>'Fi owo kun','Which visitors see which currency'=>'Àwọn àlejò wo ló máa ń rí owó wo','By country: two-letter country code (for example CH)'=>'Nípa orílẹ̀-èdè: kóòdù orílẹ̀-èdè lẹ́tà méjì (fún àpẹẹrẹ CH)','Visitors from %s'=>'Àwọn àbẹ̀wò láti %s','Let visitors choose (shortcode [tranzly_currency_switcher])'=>'Jẹ́ kí àwọn alábẹ̀wò yan (shortcode [tranzly_currency_switcher])','Prices now depend on a cookie or on the visitor’s country: make sure your page cache varies by the "tranzly_currency" cookie, or excludes shop pages.'=>'Awọn idiyele ni bayi sinmi lori kuki kan tabi lori orilẹ-ede alejo naa: ri an daju pe iṣura oju-iwe rẹ yipada nipasẹ kuki "tranzly_currency", tabi yọ awọn oju-iwe ile-itaja kuro.','Save currencies'=>'Fipamọ awọn owo nina','The words your theme and plugins print themselves (buttons, labels). Read a theme or plugin once, then translate its text here; your translation wins over the plugin’s own.'=>'Awọn ọrọ ti akori rẹ ati awọn afikun rẹ tẹjade funrararẹ (awọn bọtini, awọn aami). Ka akori tabi afikun kan ni ẹẹkan, lẹhinna tumọ ọrọ rẹ nibi; ifọwọsowọpọ rẹ bori ti afikun naa.','%d texts'=>'Awọn itọnisọna %d','not read yet'=>'a kà á sí i tẹ́lẹ̀','Read again'=>'Ka lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i','Read its text'=>'Ka ọrọ rẹ','Translate'=>'Tumọ','Job started with %d translations to do. It runs in the background: you can close this page.'=>'A bẹrẹ iṣẹ pẹlu %d awọn itumọ lati ṣe. O nṣiṣẹ ni abẹlẹ: o le pa oju-iwe yii.','Queued again.'=>'A tún ti gbé sínú àtòjọ.','Running'=>'Ó ń lọ','Finished'=>'Ti parẹ','Set up a translation engine in the Engines tab first.'=>'Fi ẹ̀rọ ìtumọ sílẹ̀ ní tàbù Ìtumọ (Engines) ní àkọ́kọ́.','Translate every'=>'Tumọ gbogbo rẹ','Into'=>'Sínú','With'=>'Pẹlu','Each language’s own engine'=>'Èrò kọ̀ọ̀kan fún èdè rẹ̀','Publish the translations (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'Ṣe àtẹ̀jáde àwọn ìtumọ̀ náà (bí bẹ́ẹ̀ kọ́ a óò fi wọ́n pamọ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí àkọọ́lẹ̀ àkọ́bẹ̀rẹ̀)','Estimate the cost'=>'Fojú aisiye iye owo naa','%1$d posts, %2$s characters. The price for this engine is not known in advance.'=>'%1$d àwọn atẹ̀jáde, %2$s àwọn álífábẹ̀tì. Iye owó fún ẹ̀rọ yìí kò mọ tẹ́lẹ̀.','%1$d posts, %2$s characters: about $%3$s on your own account.'=>'Àwọn ìfiránṣẹ́ %1$d, àwọn àlífábẹ̀tì %2$s: ó fẹ́rẹ̀ẹ́ jẹ́ $%3$s lórí àkántì ara rẹ.','Start translating'=>'Bẹrẹ titumọ','Jobs'=>'Àwọn iṣẹ́','No translation jobs yet.'=>'Ko si awọn iṣẹ itumọ kankan sibẹṣẹ.','Job %1$d — %2$s'=>'Iṣẹ %1$d — %2$s','%1$d of %2$d translated, %3$d failed, %4$d skipped (protected or already in that language)'=>'%1$d ninu %2$d ti a tumọ, %3$d kuna, %4$d foju fo (aabo tabi ti wa ni ede yẹn tẹlẹ)','Stop this job'=>'Dúró iṣẹ yii','See what failed and why'=>'Wo ohun ti o kuna ati idi rẹ̀','Content'=>'Akoonu','Language'=>'Èdè','What went wrong'=>'Kí ni ó ṣe aṣiṣe','Fix it'=>'Gbọ̀ rẹ̀','Retry with'=>'Tun gbiyanju pẹlu','The same engine'=>'Ẹrọ kan náà','Retry'=>'Tun gbiyanju','Translate by hand'=>'Tumọ pẹlu ọwọ','Menus saved.'=>'A ti fi àwọn àkójọ aṣayan pamọ́.','%d texts translated.'=>'Awọn ọrọ %d ti ni itumọ.','Saved. Your corrections are protected from machine translation.'=>'A ti fi pamọ́. A daabobo awọn atunṣe rẹ lọwọ itumọ ẹ̀rọ.','The same menu, translated'=>'Àkójọ àṣàyàn kan náà, tí a túmọ̀ sí èdè yòòmù','A separate menu per language'=>'Àtòjọ aṣàyànọtàn lọtọ fún èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan','By default each menu is translated: its links lead to the translated pages, with their titles. Choose a menu of its own for a language here instead.'=>'Nípasẹ̀ àìlàyípadà, a túmọ̀ olúkúlùkù àkójọ aṣàyàn: àwọn àsopọ̀ rẹ̀ yọrí sí ojú-ewé tí a túmọ̀, pẹ̀lú àwọn àkọlé wọn. Yan àkójọ aṣàyàn tirẹ̀ fún èdè kan níbí dípò bẹ́ẹ̀.','Shared text'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ tí a pín','Which text'=>'Èwo ni ọrọ náà','Menu labels'=>'Àwọn àmì ìtòsí àkójọ aṣàyàn','Templates, headers, footers and patterns'=>'Àwọn àpẹẹrẹ, àwọn àkọlé, àwọn ìsàlẹ̀ ojú-ewé àti àwọn àpẹẹrẹ ìṣètò','Templates, headers, footers and patterns (Pro)'=>'Àwọn àdàkọ, àwọn àkọlé, àwọn ìsàlẹ̀ ojúewé àti àwọn àpẹẹrẹ (Pro)','Translate the missing text'=>'Tumọ ọrọ ti o ku','There is no text to translate here.'=>'Kò sí ọrọ̀ kankan láti túmọ̀ sí ibi.','Corrected by a person, protected'=>'Ẹni tí a fọwọ́ sí, tí a dáàbò bo','Save corrections'=>'Fipamọ awọn atunṣe','Languages and settings'=>'Àwọn èdè àti ètò','Engines'=>'Àwọn Ẹrọ','Translation jobs'=>'Àwọn iṣẹ́ ìtumọ̀','Addresses and SEO'=>'Awọn adirẹsi ati SEO','Language switchers'=>'Àwọn olùyípadà èdè','SEO audit'=>'Àyẹ̀wò SEO','Menus and shared text'=>'Àwọn àkójọ aṣàyàn àti ọ̀rọ̀ tí a pínlò','Translation status'=>'Ipò Ìtumọ̀','Integrations'=>'Àwọn ìsopọ̀','No meta description'=>'Ko si apejuwe meta','A language version visitors cannot open (draft, private or password)'=>'Ẹya èdè tí àwọn àlejò kò lè ṣí (ìwé àkọ́kọ́, ìkọ̀kọ̀ tàbí ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà)','The address still uses the original words'=>'Àdíìrẹ̀ náà tún ń lò àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ àtilẹ̀wá náà','Still holds the original text'=>'Ṣẹ́kì nínú ọ̀rọ̀ àkọ́kọ́ náà lọ́wọ́','The multilingual SEO audit is part of Tranzly Pro. It finds missing meta descriptions, broken hreflang, untranslated addresses and duplicate content, per language.'=>'Àyẹ̀wò SEO oní-èdè púpọ̀ jẹ́ apá kan Tranzly Pro. Ó ń wá àwọn àpèjúwe meta tí ó sonù, hreflang tí ó bàjẹ́, àwọn àdírẹ́sì tí a kò túmọ̀, àti àkóópọ̀ tí ó ní ẹ̀dà méjì, fún èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan.','Language to audit'=>'Èdè fún àyẹ̀wò','Run the audit'=>'Se ayewo naa','Check the next pages'=>'Ṣayẹwo awọn oju-iwe ti o tẹle','%1$d pages checked, %2$d problems found.'=>'Awọn oju-iwe %1$d ti a ṣayẹwo, awọn iṣoro %2$d ti a rii.','The whole language has been checked.'=>'A ti ṣàyẹ̀wò gbogbo èdè náà.','Page'=>'Ojúewé','Problem'=>'Àìṣédéédé','Edit'=>'Ṣatunkọ','Job %1$d started: %2$d pages are being translated in the background. Follow it in Translation jobs.'=>'Iṣẹ́ %1$d bẹ̀rẹ̀: a ń túmọ̀ ojú-ewé %2$d lẹ́yìn-ọ̀-fẹ́fẹ́. Tẹ̀le e ninu Awọn iṣẹ itumọ.','%d translations are being checked in the background. Scores appear here as they arrive.'=>'A n ṣàyẹ̀wò àwọn ìtumọ̀ %d lẹ́yìn-ọ̀-fẹ́fẹ́. Àwọn àmì yóò hàn níhìn-ín bí wọ́n ṣe ń dé.','Missing'=>'Kò sí','Out of date'=>'Ti kọja akoko','Translated'=>'Túmọ̀ rẹ̀','Edited by a person'=>'Eniyan lo satunkọ rẹ','Machine translated'=>'Àwọn èdè tí ẹ̀rọ túmọ̀ sí','Waiting for review'=>'Nduro ayẹwo','Needs a human look'=>'O nilo akiyesi eniyan','Everything'=>'Gbogbo rẹ̀','Up to date'=>'Wọ́n ti mú un ṣe tuntun','Tranzly is still working out which older translations are out of date. The "out of date" numbers will grow while it does.'=>'Tranzly nṣiṣẹ lori lati mọ iru awọn ìtumọ àtijọ wo lo ti kọja àkókò. Awọn nọmba "ti kọja àkókò" yoo pọ si nigba ti o nṣe bẹ.','Content type'=>'Irú akópa','All content'=>'Gbogbo akoonu','Average quality'=>'Apapọ didara','%1$d translated (%2$d%%)'=>'%1$d ti a tumọ (%2$d%%)','Show'=>'Fi hàn','Translate everything missing'=>'Tumọ ohun gbogbo ti o ku','Update everything out of date'=>'Ṣe imudojuiwọn ohun gbogbo ti o ti pẹ','Check the quality with AI'=>'Ṣàyẹ̀wọ̀ dídára pẹ̀lú AI','Translate the low-scoring pages again'=>'Tún túnsọ àwọn ojú-ewé tí wọ́n ní àmì kékeré','Nothing here.'=>'Kò sí nǹkankan níbí.','Quality'=>'Didaraja','by a person'=>'nípa ènìyàn','waiting for review'=>'n duro de ayewo','Side by side'=>'Ẹgbẹ́ mẹ́jẹ','Show more'=>'Fi kun ẹ̀','Bulk translate the whole site (Pro)'=>'Tumọ gbogbo aaye rẹ ni olopobo (Pro)','With Tranzly Pro, choose content types and languages, see the estimate, and translate the whole site in one go.'=>'Pẹ̀lú Tranzly Pro, yan àwọn irú àkóópọ̀ àti àwọn èdè, wo ìṣirò náà, kí o sì túmọ̀ gbogbo ojú-wọ́wọ́ náà lẹ́ẹ̀kan náà.','%d background jobs started, one per language. Follow them in Translation jobs.'=>'Awọn iṣẹ abẹlẹ %d ti bẹrẹ, ọkan fun ede kọọkan. Tẹle wọn ninu Awọn iṣẹ itumọ.','Content types'=>'Awọn oriṣi akoonu','What to translate'=>'Ohun tí a máa tumọ̀ sí','Only what is missing'=>'Ohun ti o ku nikan','Only what is out of date'=>'Kiki ohun ti o ti pẹ','Everything (pages edited by a person stay as they are)'=>'Gbogbo rẹ (awọn oju-iwe ti eniyan ṣatunṣe yoo wa bi wọn ṣe wa)','Estimate'=>'Àìní','%1$d pages, %2$s characters. This engine does not publish a price.'=>'Àwọn ojú ewé %1$d, àwọn ìlànà lẹ́tà %2$s. Ẹrọ yìí kò gbé iye owó jáde.','%1$d pages, %2$s characters, about $%3$s.'=>'Ojú ewé %1$d, àwọn lẹ́tà %2$s, nípa $%3$s.','Find a text'=>'Wa ọrọ kan','%d more: type in "Find a text" to narrow the list.'=>'%d diẹ sii: tẹ "Wa ọrọ kan" lati dín atọka naa kù.','A small button in a corner of every page, on any theme, with no set-up.'=>'Bọtínì kékeré kan ní apaǹtì gbogbo ojú ewé, lórí èyíkéyìí tiimu, láìsí ìṣètò kankan.','Off'=>'Pa','Bottom corner, end side'=>'Ìgbọ̀nsẹ̀ ìsàlẹ̀, apá òpin','Bottom corner, start side'=>'Ìgun ìsàlẹ̀, apá ìbẹ̀rẹ̀','Top corner, end side'=>'Apakan igun oke, apa opin','Top corner, start side'=>'Ẹ̀gbẹ́ òkè, ẹ̀gbẹ́ ìbẹ̀rẹ̀','Switcher around the content'=>'Aṣẹ̀ṣe yíyípo àkóọ́lẹ̀ náà','Add a switcher to every post and page'=>'Fi à yipada kún gbogbo ifiweranṣẹ ati oju-iwe','Before the content'=>'Ṣaju akoonu naa','After the content'=>'Lẹ́yìn àkópa náà','Other ways to add a switcher'=>'Awọn ọna miiran lati fi oluyipada kun','Block editor and site editor: the “Language switcher” block, with five designs.'=>'Olùṣàtúnṣe ìdènà àti olùṣàtúnṣe ojú opo wẹ́bù: dínà “Olùyípadà èdè”, pẹ̀lu àwọn apẹrẹ márùn-ún.','Page Builder Sandwich: the “Language switcher” element.'=>'Page Builder Sandwich: nǹkan "Language switcher".','Menus: Appearance → Menus → “Language switcher” box.'=>'Àwọn àkójọ aṣàyàn: Ìfarahàn → Àwọn àkójọ aṣàyàn → àpótí “Language switcher”.','Sidebars: the “Language switcher” widget.'=>'Awọn ẹgbẹ gefe: wigi “Ayipada ede”.','Anywhere else, the shortcode:'=>'Nibi kankan miran, koodu kukuru:','Elementor and Bricks: the “Language switcher” widget in each builder.'=>'Elementor àti Bricks: widget “Language switcher” ní olùkọ̀lé kọ̀ọ̀kan.','Elementor and Bricks widgets are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Àwọn nǹkan ìdánimọ̀ Elementor àti Bricks jẹ́ apَá kan Tranzly Pro.','Save'=>'Fi pamọ́','(Pro)'=>'(Pro)','A folder per language: example.com/de/'=>'Fáàlì kan fún èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan: example.com/de/','A subdomain per language: de.example.com'=>'Subdomain kan fún èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan: de.example.com','A separate domain per language: example.de'=>'Àìṣọ̀kan agbègbè fún èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan: example.de','A query parameter: example.com/?lang=de (older sites)'=>'Gbólóhùn ìbéèrè ìwádìí: example.com/?lang=de (àwọn ojú òpó wẹ́bù tó ti pẹ́)','Category'=>'Orísi','Tag'=>'Àmì','Product'=>'Ọjà','Product category'=>'Ẹka ọja','Product tag'=>'Àmì ọjà','Saved. Your language addresses have changed as shown below.'=>'A ti fi pamọ́. Àwọn àdírẹ́sì èdè rẹ ti yí padà gẹ́gẹ́ bí ó ṣe hàn ní ìsàlẹ̀ yìí.','Language in the address'=>'Èdè nínú àdírẹ́sì','How visitors and search engines reach each language'=>'Bẹ́ẹ̀ ni àwọn alábàábẹ̀wò àti àwọn ẹ̀rọ àwárí ṣe ń dé ọ̀dọ̀ èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan','Address word for %s'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ àdíréẹ̀ fún %s','The default language has no word in its addresses.'=>'Èdè àkọkọ kò ní ọ̀rọ̀ kankan nínú àwọn àdírẹ́sì rẹ̀.','Domain for %s (optional)'=>'Agbegbe wẹbụ fun %s (aṣayan)','Point the domain at this site first. A language with no domain uses a folder on your main domain.'=>'Kọ agbegbe naa si aaye yii ni akọkọ. Ede kan ti ko ni agbegbe nlo folda kan lori agbegbe akọkọ rẹ.','Where each language lives now'=>'Nibikiti ti ede kọọkan n gbe bayii','Translated address words'=>'Awọn ọrọ adirẹsi ti a tumọ si','Page and post addresses come from their translated titles. Here you translate the fixed words, so /de/kategorie/ replaces /de/category/.'=>'Àwọn àtọmọ adírẹ́sì ojú ewé àti àtúnṣe wá láti inú àwọn àkọlé tí a ti túmọ̀ wọn. Níbì yìí o túmọ̀ àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ tí a ti múlẹ̀, nítorí náà /de/kategorie/ rọ́pò /de/category/.','%1$s (now “%2$s”)'=>'%1$s (bayìí ni “%2$s”)','Search engines and visitors'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀rọ ìwárí àti àwọn alábèwò','Offer visitors their own language with a small banner (never a redirect)'=>'Fun awọn alejo ni ede tiwọn pẹlu asia kekere kan (kii ṣe atọnisọna lailai)','Hide untranslated pages from search engines (noindex)'=>'Fi awọn oju-ewe ti a ko tumọ pamọ kuro lọwọ awọn ẹ̀rọ àwárí (noindex)','A translation that still holds the original text is kept out of search results until it is translated.'=>'Ìtumọ̀ kan tí ó ṣì ní ọ̀rọ̀ àkọ́kọ́ nínú ni a máa ń yọ kúrò nínú àwọn èsì wíwá titi di ìgbà tí a ó fi tú ẹ̀.','Part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Apakan Tranzly Pro.','Tranzly adds hreflang links (with x-default), the page language and direction, and every language to your sitemap:'=>'Tranzly fi àwọn àsopọ̀ hreflang (pẹ̀lú x-default), èdè ojú-ewé àti ìtọ́sọ́nà, àti gbogbo èdè kún sitemap rẹ:','Working together with: %s.'=>'Ṣiṣẹ pọ pẹlu: %s.','Each address word is 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens.'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ àdírẹ̀sì kọ̀ọ̀dù jẹ́ lẹ́tà kékeré 2 sí 12, àwọn nọ́mbà tàbí àwọn àmì ìdájọ́ (hyphens).','Auto-translate on update, reviewer roles, XLIFF export for translators, switching from WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress and the AI quality check come with Tranzly Pro.'=>'Ìtumọ̀ fúnra rẹ̀ nígbà tí wọ́n bá ṣe àtúnṣe, ipa àwọn olùkẹ́kọ̀ọ́, ìj\'ajade XLIFF fún àwọn olùtumọ̀, yíyípadà láti WPML, Polylang tàbí TranslatePress àti àyẹ̀wò àìlẹ́gbẹ́ AI wá pẹ̀lú Tranzly Pro.','When an original changes'=>'Nígbà tí ohun àkọ́kọ́ bá yí padà','When a page is edited'=>'Nígbà tí wọ́n bá ṣàtúnṣe ojúewé kan','Mark its translations out of date'=>'Fi àwọn ìtumọ̀ rẹ̀ sípò pé wọn kò tíì di ìsinsìnyí','Translate its translations again in the background'=>'Tún túmọ̀ àwọn ìtúmọ̀ rẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i ní abẹ́lẹ̀','Do nothing'=>'Má ṣe ohunkohun kankan','A translation a person edited is never overwritten; it is marked out of date instead.'=>'À túmọ̀ tí ènìyàn sẹ́ túnkò níí gbé orí rẹ̀ tí ì túmọ̀ mìíràn; dípòbéèni, wón máa ǹ sam̀ì sí pé ó ti péjọ.','Translate new pages into every language when they are published'=>'Tumọ awọn oju-iwe tuntun si gbogbo ede nigbati a ba tẹ wọn jade','A second AI model reads each translation beside its original, scores it and names the mistakes. It uses your own AI key from the AI settings. Start a check from Translation status.'=>'Àwoṣe AI keji n ka ìtumọ kọọkan lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́ atilẹba rẹ̀, ó ṣe àgbéyẹ̀wò rẹ̀ ó sì sọ àwọn àṣìṣe náà. Ó nlo bọ́tìnnì AI tirẹ̀ láti inú àwọn ètò AI. Bẹ̀rẹ̀ àyẹ̀wò kan láti ipò ìtumọ̀.','AI provider'=>'Olupese AI','The AI settings’ general model'=>'Àwòṣe ìlò gbogbo ti àwọn ètò AI','Recommended'=>'A ṁ fẹran','A page needs a human look below this score'=>'Oju-iwe kan nilo iwo aniyan eniyan ni isalẹ ami yii','Publish only translations a reviewer approved'=>'Tẹ awọn ìtumọ̀ nìkan jáde tí alátẹ̀wò fọwọ́ sí','Give people the Translator role (edits translations, never the originals, cannot publish) or the Translation reviewer role (also approves). Reviewers also find everything waiting in the Posts and Pages lists under “Pending”; publishing one there approves it.'=>'Fún àwọn ènìyàn ní ipò Translator (ó ń ṣe àtúnṣe àwọn ìtumọ̀, kì í ṣe àwọn ìpilẹ̀ṣẹ̀, kò lè tẹ̀ jáde) tàbí ipò Translation reviewer (ó tún ń fọwọ́ sí i). Àwọn olùyẹ̀wò tún ń wá ohun gbogbo tí ó ń dúró de nínú àwọn àkójọ Posts àti Pages lábé “Pending”; títẹ̀ sí èkejì nínú wọn jáde fọwọ́ sí i.','Manage users'=>'Ṣakoso awọn olumulo','Nothing is waiting for review.'=>'Ko si ohun ti o n duro de ayewo.','Note for the translator (optional)'=>'Àkíyèsí fún olùtúmọ̀ (aṣàyàn)','Read side by side'=>'Ka ni ẹ̀gbẹ́-kẹgbẹ́','Approve'=>'Fọwọsi','Ask for changes'=>'Bẹ́ẹ̀ sí àwọn àtúnṣe','%d translations imported and protected from machine translation.'=>'%d awọn atumọ ti wọ inu ati aabo lati inu itumọ ẹrọ.','Export and import for translators'=>'Àwọn olùtumọ̀ wọlé kí wọ̀ sì jáde','Not translated yet'=>'Ko tii tumọ si','Already translated'=>'Ti tumọ tẹlẹ','Format'=>'Ọna kika','XLIFF 1.2 (translation tools)'=>'XLIFF 1.2 (awọn irinṣẹ itumọ)','CSV (spreadsheets)'=>'CSV (àwọn ìwé ìtànkálẹ̀)','Download the file'=>'Ṣe igbasilẹ fáìlì náà','Import a translated file'=>'Ko wọ inu fáìlì tí a ti túmọ̀ sí èdè mi','Undone: %1$d links removed, %2$d imported pages deleted.'=>'Ko ṣe: Awọn ọna asopọ %1$d ti yọ kuro, awọn oju-iwe wọle %2$d ti a parẹ.','Dry run, nothing changed:'=>'Idanwo gbigbẹ, kò sí ohun tí a yipada:','Imported:'=>'Wọ́n ti kó wọlé:','%1$d languages added, %2$d translations linked, %3$d pages built, %4$d texts.'=>'Awon ede %1$d ti a fi kun, awon itumo %2$d ti a sopo, awon oju opo webu %3$d ti a ko, awon oro %4$d.','Switch the other plugin off first (its addresses and switchers would fight Tranzly). Its data stays where it is, so you can switch back; Undo removes exactly what the import added.'=>'Pa plọọgi miiran naa kọkọ (awọn adirẹsi rẹ ati awọn oluyipada yoo ba Tranzly ja). Awọn data rẹ duro ni ibi ti o wa, nitorina o le yipada sẹhin; Ìmúpadà yọ kuro deede ohun ti agbewọle naa ṣafikun.','No data from this plugin on this site.'=>'Ko si data lati inu agbekale yii lori aaye yii.','Languages: %s'=>'Àwọn èdè: %s','still active: switch it off first.'=>'sì wà lọ́wọ́: pa á rẹ́ kọ́kọ́.','Dry run'=>'Ayẹwo akọkọ','Import'=>'Gbe wọle','Undo the import'=>'Fagile wọ inu ọkọ yẹn ka','Comments and product reviews'=>'Àwọn àlàyé àti àwọn àyẹ̀wò ọjà','Each language keeps its own'=>'Gbogbo èdè ní ėti àṣà rẹ̀','Show every language’s comments on every version'=>'Fi àwọn àlàyé èdè kọọkan hàn lórí ẹ̀yà kọọkan','Show them all, translated into the reader’s language'=>'Fi gbogbo wọn han, ti a tú si èdè olùkàwé','Translating uses your translation engine for every approved comment. Spam and comments waiting for moderation are never sent.'=>'Ṣíṣe ìtumọ̀ ń lo ẹ̀rọ ìtumọ̀ rẹ fún gbogbo àwọn àlàyé tí a fọwọ́ sí. A kì í rán àwọn ìtànǹrì àti àwọn àlàyé tí ń dúró de ìfọwọ́sí láé.','Saved. The pieces you changed are marked as checked by a person, and this translation is protected from machine translation.'=>'A ti fi pamọ́. Àwọn ẹ̀yà tí o yí padà ni a fi àmì sí pé ènìyàn ló ṣàyẹ̀wò wọn, wọ́n sì dáàbò bo ìtumọ̀ yìí lọ́wọ́ ìtumọ̀ ẹ̀rọ.','The layout of this translation was changed in the editor, so some pieces no longer pair with the original. Pieces without a partner are shown empty; edit the rest in the editor.'=>'Awon ipilẹ ìtumọ yii ti yipada ninu olùṣàtúnṣe, nitorina diẹ ninu awọn ege ko ba ara wọn mu mọ pẹlu atilẹba naa. Awọn ege laisi alabaṣepọ ni a fihan ni asan; ṣatunṣe awọn iyokù ninu olùṣàtúnṣe.','Open the editor'=>'Ṣí olootu naa','Original (%s)'=>'Atilẹkọ (%s)','Translation (%s)'=>'Ìtumọ̀ (%s)','Save changes'=>'Fipamọ awọn ayipada','Open in the editor'=>'Ṣí nínú olóòtú','Checked by a person'=>'Ẹni tó ṣe ayẹ̀wọ̀ rẹ̀','Imported'=>'Ti a ko wọle','Not in the translation'=>'Kò sí nínú ìtumọ̀ náà','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Fi ede keji kun labẹ Tranzly ni akojọ aṣayan abojuto, yoo si han nibi.','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'Pa a fún àìní: àfìhàmọ̀ jẹ́ orílẹ̀-èdè, kì í ṣe èdè.','What screen readers announce, for example “Choose a language”.'=>'Ohun tí àwọn olùkà aṣọ bẹ́ẹ̀ ń kéde, fún àpẹrẹ “Yan èdè kan”.','Colours'=>'Àwọn àwọ̀','Not translated'=>'Ko ti tumọ','Original'=>'Atilẹba','Published'=>'Ti a gbejade','Draft'=>'Àkọọlẹ́ ti kò tíì parí','Checked by a person, protected'=>'Àyẹ̀wò láti ọ̀dọ̀ ènìyàn, ní ìbòjúgbé','Imported, protected'=>'Ti a ko wọle, ti a daabobo','Not translated yet (a copy)'=>'Kò tíì túmọ̀ (ẹ̀kọ́ kan)','Save this post first, then translate it here.'=>'Fipamọ post yii kọkọ, lẹhinna tumọ rẹ si ibi.','View'=>'Wo','Unlock so it can be translated again'=>'Ṣí i kí a lè tún tún un ṣe','Protect'=>'Dabobo','Publish the translations'=>'Tẹ awọn ìtumọ jade','Translate into %d language'=>'Tumọ si èdè %d','%s: translated.'=>'%s: a tumo.','Show this block'=>'Fi dídì yìí hàn','In every language'=>'Ní gbogbo èdè','Only in the languages ticked'=>'Ninu awọn ede ti a samisi nikan','In every language except those ticked'=>'Ninu gbogbo ede ayafi awọn ti a samisi','Image per language'=>'Àwòrán fún èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan','Show another image to readers of a language, for example a banner with words on it.'=>'Fi àwòrán mìíràn hàn fún àwọn olùkàwí èdè kan, fún àpẹẹrẹ àsíá kan tí ó ní àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ lórí rẹ̀.','Replace the %s image'=>'Rọ́pọ̀ àwòrán %s náà','Choose a %s image'=>'Yan aworan %s kan','Use the original image'=>'Lo aworan atilẹba rẹ','Correct this translation'=>'Ṣe àtúnṣe ìtumọ̀ yìí','Saving…'=>'Ńpamọ́ lọwọ́…','Translated text. Press Enter to correct it.'=>'Ìṣe àgbésọ̀kalẹ̀ náà ti parí. Tẹ Enter láti ṣe àtúnṣe rẹ̀.','Click any outlined text to correct its translation.'=>'Tẹ èyíkéyìí ìkọ̀ tí a ya sọ́tọ̀ láti ṣàtúnṣe ìtumọ̀ rẹ̀.','No translated text was found on this page to edit here. Use the side-by-side editor instead.'=>'A ko ri ọ̀rọ̀ kankan tí a ti tumọ̀ sori oju-iwe yii lati ṣatunṣe nibi. Lo oluṣatunṣe ti o wa lẹgbẹ ara wọn dipo.','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Aláyípadà èdè','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'Awọn ọna aṣopọ si oju-iwe yii ni olukuluku awọn ede aaye naa. Ko ni han ohunkohun titi ti a o fi ṣe akoስተ awọn ede meji tabi ju bẹ lọ.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Èdè','block keywordswitcher'=>'Olutiraka','block keywordtranslation'=>'Ìtumọ̀','block descriptionLets visitors read this page in another of your languages: a list, pills, buttons, a dropdown or language codes, with optional flags.'=>'Jẹ ki awọn alejo ka oju-iwe yii ni ede miiran ti o ni: atokọ, awọn ìpilísì, awọn bọtini, akojọ aṣayan ti o n jo silẹ tabi awọn koodu ede, pẹlu awọn aami ifihan ti o ba fẹ.','block keywordmultilingual'=>'ọ̀pọ̀ èdè']];